{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04263","headline":"浮槎 · 骆宾王","name":"浮槎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔负千寻质，高临九仞峰。\n真心凌晚桂，劲节掩寒松。\n忽值风飙折，坐爲波浪冲。\n摧残空有恨，拥肿遂无庸。\n渤海三千里，泥沙几万重。\n似舟飘不定，如梗泛何从。\n仙客终难托，良工岂易逢。\n徒怀万乘器，谁爲一先容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}